@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/sen0414-ch2125corr-lineage#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
ex:Mission15 a backlog:Mission ; rdfs:label "Every SEN0414 chapter page and deck meets the rulings of 2026-11-27"@en ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_InFlight ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin "Owner's rulings of 2026-11-27 (chapter 11 urgency, extended by 'These should be applied to all chapters and submit a handover to CME') and of 2026-11-24 (no everyday analogies, no lambdas unless taught, reader-facing notes), the urgent interruption of Lineage14 recorded in register 1.25.0." ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "Every chapter of SEN0414 (chapters 1 to 25) has an interactive page with a Slide source code tab that runs the slide code in order, with exam result and answers open after finishing, exam questions about the subject, never about the book, and no lambda unless the subject teaches it, and a deck with code slides that carry a goal line, meaning, reason and idea balloons, a watch-out and a predict prompt and with notes that speak to the reader, as the owner ruled on 2026-11-27 and 2026-11-24, with no slide added to any deck and the content of the chapters unchanged." ;
    backlog:missionFor ex:Backlog15 .
ex:Lineage15 backlog:lineageForMission ex:Mission15 .
